    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Use the dot diagram to explain why the sum of the first $n$ positive integers is $\\frac{1}{2}n(n+1)$.\n\n$$1+2+3+4+\\cdots+n=\\frac{1}{2}n(n+1)$$",
